  "problemStatement": {
    "formal": "\\forall T>0,\\ \\forall f\\in L^2(\\mathrm{AddCircle}\\ T;\\mathbb{C}),\\ \\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb{Z}} |\\widehat f(n)|^2 = \\int_{\\mathrm{AddCircle}\\ T} |f(t)|^2\\,d\\mu(t).",
